WEBVTT

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.820
What were you thinking?

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.620
Picking a fight with Himekawa from Nada!

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.650
<i>I'll kill you, in golf.</i>

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:17.990
<i>I'll pierce you through...</i>

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:23.170
<i>...with my Rainbow Bullets!</i>

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.300
You and Aoi are first-years! New to this!

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.930
Who cares? We're going to fight anyway!

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.200
Apologize!

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.070
No!

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:32.960
Come on!

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.450
Everyone there now hates our school.

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.400
We're now the crowd's enemy.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.050
That was going to happen anyway.

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:47.980
<b>The All-Japan Girls High School Golf Doubles Championship</b>

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:47.990
Athena's putting on the tournament, 
and its CEO's only daughter is getting all the attention.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.230
Everyone was going to 
be gunning for her anyway.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.560
I know that some people don't like me.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.750
And that's why you need to stay quiet.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:04.950
You need to be humble and 
sportsmanlike so that your image...

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:07.540
I know that my mom 
and grandfather have their plans.

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:12.400
But I don't want that stuff to tie me down.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.140
Thanks to Eve, I'm over it!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:18.680
We'll just have to win!

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.240
Not just win.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:21.850
Win overwhelmingly.

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:24.260
Yeah, let's.

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:29.430
I like that about you.

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:35.470
E-Eve?

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:37.220
What are you doing?!

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:38.930
It's normal, right?

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:41.950
This is Japan! Not Nafrece!

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.650
Do <i>not</i> do that in front of the reporters!

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:47.400
Actually, never do it again!

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:53.010
Lily... lily flowers blooming!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:38.510
U-Um, the first round of the championship is over, 
and 16 teams have withdrawn.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:40.880
32 remain.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:46.580
We at Nada are a seed school, 
so we skip the first round, um...

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:49.260
And our opponent is Shimane...

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:51.920
That's not what we're interested in.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:53.600
Y-Yes.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:58.020
I'm the team's advisor, but in name only. 
I don't really have anything to tell you.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.290
Don't worry.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:02.480
We'll win.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:06.800
O-Of course! I believe in you!

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:11.280
Mizuho, we're not fighting Shimane.

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:12.310
We're fighting Raiou!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:16.310
We're getting revenge for the qualifiers.

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:22.550
A-Aoi, you'll share a room with me.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.550
Why?

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:27.330
Don't the players share a room?

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:29.200
No. It's dangerous.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.930
Let's go sleep together then, little one.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:34.960
What? What?

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.160
Let's just go.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:38.530
Eve!

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:39.920
It's fun to tease her.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.430
You're gonna get stabbed someday.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:43.640
Coach...

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:45.270
Men and women get different rooms.

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:45.830
Coach...

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:46.940
Different rooms.

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:51.680
S-Shouldn't we be more 
worried about the match?

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.690
<i>I Think Who Gets What Room</i>

