00:04:54.690 --> 00:05:00.470
<i>Hole 1  420 yards  Par 4</i>

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.880
Nice shot, Kuyo.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.240
Your turn for the second shot.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:23.120
Of course. I'll get it on the green.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:26.930
You're best at putting. I'm counting on you.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:28.680
Of course.

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:34.760
The first match of the 2nd round has begun.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:38.810
A 1up with a birdie on the first hole...

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:43.540
Koran's going to keep winning, 
from the look of it.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:46.480
They'll play us in the semifinals.

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:49.060
What's wrong, Saotome?

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:50.650
Are you not feeling well?

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:56.080
Keeping Amawashi and Eve 
in separate rooms was the right move.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:02.420
You're too rough, Eve...

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.840
I had no idea she was such a bad sleeper...

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:13.400
I feel like an idiot for being just 
a little excited when she came into my bed.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:16.320
I... I'm really glad we kept them separate!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.340
When do we play?

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:22.440
Game 8. Another hour or so?

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:24.770
I can't wait.

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:27.980
Me too! I'm excited!

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:30.820
No way, right?

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:33.950
<b>Koran High</b>

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:33.950
<b>Sayama High</b>

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:38.980
<i>After the 9th hole in the first game of the 
second round, Shizuoka's Koran has a 3up lead.</i>

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:45.120
Day drinking in the clubhouse 
instead of cheering on your girls?

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:46.570
Amuro?

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:49.290
Is that how a teacher should behave?

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:52.480
The game belongs to the players.

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:55.060
There's nothing for a coach to do.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.010
Want some?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.010
I'll pass.

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:02.390
I'm sorry for borrowing 
Iijima the other day.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:06.550
Kaoruko agreed to it.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:08.180
I let her do what she wants.

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:10.480
And while I'm apologizing...

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:14.120
We'll be winning the championship.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.360
Listen to yourself.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:22.070
Aoi Amawashi's a genius, 
maybe, but still a first-year.

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:24.720
Do you think a little girl 
who's not physically grown

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:28.750
can beat Nada's Himekawa or our Kaoruko?

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.380
And if I say the answer is yes?

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:39.900
<i>The first hole of the 8th game begins, 
with Evangeline from Raiou having honor.</i>

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.230
Here I go...

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:48.060
Show everyone your bullets!

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.520
Sure thing!

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:50.960
Direct strike...

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:53.570
Blue Bullet!

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.770
T-That shot...

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:03.150
You recognize it?

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:09.260
It's just like that of the 
legendary golfer, Leo Millafoden!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:14.400
Where did you find the blonde girl, Amuro?

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.140
How did you get her to join your team?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.910
She came to us.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:21.350
She said she wanted to play Aoi Amawashi.

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:26.860
<b>Raiou Girls High</b>

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:26.860
<b>Dejima Girls High</b>

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.860
The second coming of Leo Millafoden...?

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.760
I told you.

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:31.000
We're going to win the championship.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:34.960
Aoi Amawashi, a girl 
who inherited her parents’ talent,

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:43.450
and received all the training and equipment 
Athena could give her, and one more...

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:50.890
A monster named Evangeline, who was 
trained by the legendary Leo Millafoden.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.950
<b>Raiou Girls High</b>

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.950
<b>Dejima Girls High</b>

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:55.510
Hey, at least say "nice shot" or something.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:57.170
You're always nice.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:59.290
Sure, but...

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:04.140
We'll finish this on Hole 10.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.680
So bold!

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:07.280
It's just like golf.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:10.740
You get the ball to the pin 
as fast as you can, then ram it in.

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:13.270
I'm good at that, too!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.870
Let's go, partner.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:18.360
Okay, partner!

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:21.520
T-They seem to be doing well...

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.010
I'm glad!

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:25.920
It was worth the kick to the face!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:32.200
<i>Hole 14 148 Yards Par 3</i>

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.060
<i>In the Zone.</i>

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.910
<i>Now we've won!</i>

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:09.580
<i>The first match ends with a 5-3 win 
by Iijima and Iseshiba from Koran.</i>

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.950
C-Congratulations.

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:14.120
Thanks.

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.280
I should've known we couldn't beat you.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.420
No...

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:21.000
Kaoruko, can I go see the other games?

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:25.110
If you're going to see 
Raiou, I'll go with you.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:30.840
<i>Hole 7 480 Yards Par 5</i>

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.770
Where are Eve and Amawashi?

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.900
What? They're fighting.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.980
Two on. We're going for a two on.

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:43.060
Their tee shot went into the rough, 
so the best they can get is par!

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:45.400
A birdie is enough to get us an up!

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:49.910
Let's do match play, not stroke play.

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:52.760
That's not my golf!

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:57.110
If it falls into the bunker in front of the green, 
we'll lose our shot at a birdie!

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:00.550
You think I'd screw up like that?

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.760
It went into the bunker at Hole 3!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:03.840
I'm going for it!

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:05.090
Shut up.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.490
W-What are they fighting over?

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:09.000
Eve wants a two on.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.140
Why?!

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:13.330
There's no need to gamble here.

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:15.520
For her, there is.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.400
<i>Yeah, that's true.</i>

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:20.740
<i>That's how Eve plays golf.</i>

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:25.200
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:30.680
Okay!

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:31.260
Go!

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:37.280
Sorry.

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:39.550
I just told you!

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:42.780
Look at them!

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:45.330
Hahaha, what a screwup!

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.900
They're going to lose.

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:50.020
I don't think there's anything 
to laugh at, Kuyo.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.330
6up?!

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.900
<b>Raiou Girls Academy</b>

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.900
<b>Dejima Girls Academy</b>

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:58.630
They've won every hole.

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:02.790
Raiou were at the top 
of the qualifiers for a reason.

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:05.790
Eve, you dummy! Eve, 
you dummy! Eve, you dummy!!

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:11.790
Come on, the Aoi Amawashi 
I know you can recover from this!

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:14.320
Maybe you could get it right in the cup?

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:17.330
W-Well, I'm sure I could.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:18.800
So easy.

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:23.550
When things are scary, you smile.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.310
Go!

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:30.620
It's out!

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:31.930
Nice out!

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:39.230
Why are you laughing?

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:43.240
We're a pair! Be frustrated with me!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.990
Jeez!

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.330
Eve, you dummy!

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:56.560
We're 6up as of Hole 13.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:13:00.000
The match ended six and five, 
and we're through the first round.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:05.780
The numbers look good, 
but that second stroke on 7...

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:07.800
What were you doing?

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:12.170
And there were two other holes you 
could've won if you hadn't gambled.

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:14.230
Who cares? We won!

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.420
Listen to me...

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:19.760
I-I support Eve's challenges.

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:20.920
Saotome...

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:25.900
Sure, I think there was no need to go 
for a two on at that point on Hole 7.

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.010
What?

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:32.770
But if we're not continually aggressive, 
we can't beat Koran or Nada.

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.260
When we get to the quarterfinals,

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:37.530
things will be so tough that 
even getting a 1up will be hard.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:43.180
I think when we get there, 
we're going to need that aggression.

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.250
Smart thinking, little one.

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:48.130
Apologize!

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:49.550
You girls.

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.160
President Jinguuji?

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:54.610
What are you doing?

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.480
Amawashi. Eve.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:14:00.440
While you're screwing around, 
your enemies are building.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.690
Building a thick, tall wall.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:10.270
<i>Hole 7 480 Yards Par 5</i>

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:19.210
She made an easy two on at 7, 
where Eve screwed up...

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.350
An easy eagle putt.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:31.580
Total... 7up.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:37.010
Mizuho Himekawa's average 
drive is 247 yards.

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:41.890
Her fairway keep rate is 81.3 percent.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.890
Her average putt is 1.75.

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:47.040
These numbers are impressive.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:52.100
<i>Hole 10 421 Yards Par 4</i>

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:54.370
<i>It's so similar...</i>

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:59.030
<i>The way she puts down the tee. 
Her stance. Her swing...</i>

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.920
<i>It's like Dad's golf!</i>

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:07.400
<i>Aoi Amawashi...</i>

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:12.720
<i>Kazuhiko Hodaka's 
daughter, the aloof genius.</i>

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:16.420
<i>She excites me...</i>

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:26.810
<i>Even the trajectory is the same!</i>

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:33.020
I-It went almost 270 yards!

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:35.160
I can do that too.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:38.340
No, I can tell from her 
swing and trajectory!

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:42.930
She could shoot that shot a hundred times 
and it would land in the same place!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.980
<i>W-What beautiful golf...</i>

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:51.900
We have to beat them to win, don't we?

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:53.400
Yes, of course.

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:57.110
They're the strongest high 
school students in Japan.

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:04.220
That bitch...

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:13.240
<i>Amawashi, you carry the blood 
of Kazuhiko Hodaka, the genius pro golfer.</i>

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:19.000
<i>But the one who truly inherited 
the golf of Kazuhiko Hodaka...</i>

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:25.520
<i>...is me. Mizuho Himekawa!</i>

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:32.170
T-They ended the game in just 10 holes?

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:32.170
<b>Nadaminami Athletic</b>

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:32.170
<b>Tojima Girls High</b>

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:36.400
<i>The 16th game of the 2nd round ended 
with the pair of Oikawa and</i>

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:37.630
You guys showed off in the qualifiers 
and now she's all serious.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:42.180
<i>Himekawa from Nadaminami 
getting a perfect 10-8 win...</i>

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:40.250
You should've known better.

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:42.180
This is what I wanted.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:48.360
It's not a real victory unless we beat Nada.

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:51.670
What's your hurry?

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.280
They're both first-years, right?

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:59.200
Why not take two years to train them, 
then send them to the pros?

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:04.170
There's no time.

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:08.680
Amuro, you...

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:17.230
<i>We were in the top 2 during the qualifiers,</i>

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:22.440
<i>but we saw in the first round of the 
Nationals just how much better Nada was.</i>

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:28.760
<i>Of course, Eve was a pissed off mess.</i>

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:32.460
<i>For her part, Amawashi was quiet.</i>

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:36.950
<i>Watching their match again and again.</i>

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:39.240
Saotome, are you listening to me?

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:45.870
<i>Shinjo and I used Nada's score as the 
basis to form a new plan for the course.</i>

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:48.740
<i>There's no time to be yelling at each other!</i>

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:53.730
<i>Coach Amuro really 
didn't say anything to us.</i>

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:56.510
<i>He seemed lost in thought.</i>

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:59.270
<i>I can tell!</i>

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:04.930
<i>Eve and Amawashi are silently 
burning with fighting spirit.</i>

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:16.150
<i>And the next day, the third round...</i>

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:19.870
<i>We're up against Saita East, 
a tough opponent!</i>

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:21.740
I'm going in aggressive today.

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:24.810
Yeah. I'll do the same.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:26.540
I'll learn to enjoy playing aggressive.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:30.890
Let's show Himekawa and 
that bitch next to her who's better!

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:35.960
Just like how she stole my heart, 
I want her to see my golf.

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:37.560
What?

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:38.840
You in love?

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.920
You're the only one I like, Eve.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:43.560
I don't like or dislike you.

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:45.470
Yeah, I know.

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:49.520
Let's go, partner.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.240
Okay, partner!

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:56.860
<i>Pierce your opponent's heart 
clean through with a single shot.</i>

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:01.710
<i>Destroy them mentally.</i>

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:04.780
<i>Make it so they'll never 
want to face you again.</i>

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:08.090
<i>Load the bullet.</i>

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:09.910
<i>Cock the hammer.</i>

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.090
<i>Aim.</i>

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.660
<i>Pull the trigger.</i>

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:16.760
<i>And fire it from the barrel!</i>

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:18.600
<i>Direct strike...</i>

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:21.210
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.420
<i>I'll kill her!</i>

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:30.690
<i>I'll kill her, in golf!</i>

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:34.200
<i>With my Rainbow Bullets!</i>

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:42.790
<i>Just like I expected, 
Eve and Amawashi went in hard.</i>

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:54.710
<i>And they defeated Saita East 7-5!</i>

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.710
<b>Raiou Girls Academy</b>

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.710
<b>Saita East Girls</b>

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:56.230
<i>But...</i>

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:01.330
<i>Koran must've been inspired 
by seeing Nada yesterday,</i>

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:04.360
<i>because they made it 
through the third round 8-7.</i>

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:04.340
<b>Koran Girls High</b>

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:04.340
<b>Nimoto Matsu Girls</b>

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:11.890
<i>And Nada won 9-7!</i>

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:11.890
<b>Nadaminami Athletic</b>

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:11.890
<b>Shozuka Girls High</b>

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:16.040
<i>Of course, Eve...</i>

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:17.850
<i>Same as before.</i>

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:24.850
<i>CEO, Akihiro Date is calling.</i>

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:27.520
<i>Will you answer?</i>

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:31.700
Date? Sure, put him through.

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:33.120
<i>Understood.</i>

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:34.850
<i>Hey, Seira.</i>

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:36.410
<i>It's been a while.</i>

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:38.420
You seem to be doing well, Date.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:39.930
<i>Not at all.</i>

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:44.280
<i>Your girls are making 
a mess of the tournament.</i>

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:46.240
Sorry about that.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:48.880
But we're not letting you win.

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:51.860
For the Amawashi family's grand goal?

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:53.530
<i>That's right.</i>

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:58.600
<i>Winning the All-American, 
All-British, all 5 big majors,</i>

00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:01.230
<i>and making Athena the #1 brand in the world.</i>

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:06.370
My daughter has the blood 
and talent to do it.

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:10.990
<i>You know about Amuro's health, right?</i>

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:21.040
Reiya... no, Coach Amuro... had agreed.

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:22.490
<i>I see.</i>

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:25.410
<i>We'll struggle as best we can, then.</i>

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:26.470
<i>Bye.</i>

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:27.460
Bye.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:31.220
Those damned Amawashi...

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:35.980
Why do they have to 
keep ruining people's lives?!

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:43.430
Today we beat Nada!

00:21:43.430 --> 00:21:47.200
Today we're playing Kamuy 
Girls, from Hokkaido.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.640
Well, we'll beat them too!

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:50.140
And Nada too!

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:54.170
You have to pay a penalty 
each time you make a mistake.

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:56.340
Each time you make a mistake, 
you owe me a burger.

00:21:56.780 --> 00:21:58.340
And if you make a mistake?

00:21:59.430 --> 00:22:00.710
I'll give you a kiss.

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:05.860
I'm gonna do great today!

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:08.480
<i>She really is easy.</i>

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:50.070
Next Episode

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:44.310
Looks like there's some history 
between Koran's Iijima and Coach Amuro.

00:23:44.310 --> 00:23:46.050
Aren't you interested in what it is?

00:23:46.050 --> 00:23:46.730
Not really?

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:48.280
You're no fun!

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:50.280
More Birdie Birdie next time!
